{"t":"Stealth Ring Quest","s":"stealth-ring-quest-d406a","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Stealth_Ring_Quest_Map_01_cc41cd.jpg","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Stealth Ring Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Minotaur Pyramid Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(40 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.61-6.97<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 14, 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>...\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Pyramid\">Minotaur Pyramid</a> north-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mages</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummy</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Ring</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Amulet\">Protection Amulet</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p>This quest is not at all complicated, just dangerous.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Head to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Pyramid\">Minotaur Pyramid</a> north-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33312,32282,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33312, 32282, 7)</a>). You will only have to face <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaurs\">Minotaurs</a> on the ground level.</li>\n<li>Go down the staircase. Down these steps you will face <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaurs\">Minotaurs</a> and one or two <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>.</li>\n<li>Follow this path to the south-west, and go down another staircase:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Stealth Ring Quest Map 01\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"115\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stealth_Ring_Quest_Map_01_cc41cd.jpg\" width=\"126\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Head to the East/North-East. There will be several <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a> on this floor. There will be another staircase to go down. On the next level are all kinds of <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaurs\">Minotaurs</a>, including about 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mages</a>:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Stealth Ring Quest Map 02\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"113\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stealth_Ring_Quest_Map_02_db534a.jpg\" width=\"111\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>On this level, head North. Look for another staircase down. Down this staircase, you will face one <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummy</a>:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Stealth Ring Quest Map 03\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"107\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stealth_Ring_Quest_Map_03_47051e.jpg\" width=\"109\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>After killing the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummy</a>, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Ring</a> can be found in the south-east coffin, and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Amulet\">Protection Amulet</a> can be found in the north-east coffin:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Stealth Ring Quest Map 04\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"104\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stealth_Ring_Quest_Map_04_ea6677.jpg\" width=\"105\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["the-explorer-society-quest"]}